The prawn is a special aquarium that is used to grow and keep prawns. Most of the prawns brought into the aquarium are the result of the hybridization of several species, and the bright colors make them attractive.
Although most shrimp are good at room temperature, it is best to install a heater to keep a stable temperature of 24 to 26 degrees. This is because most rooms experience temperature changes during the day (differences between day and night, door opening, etc.).
As we have mentioned before, we must have all the necessary accessories so that the shrimp can function in good conditions. Therefore, we are going to summarize all the aspects to take into account:
