In the same way that these tablets act sticks or cookies that we find in any establishment specialized in pets. They basically consist of I think pressed, which is gradually diluted in the aquarium water.
As a last resort, which is perhaps the most effective, we are presented that fish food dispensers. These devices are placed on the surface of the water, for example on the upper edge of the fish tank, and release the food stored in its tank to the guide based on the previous programming that we have made.
