4 Are farrowing pens really good?
As we mentioned in the introduction, a farrowing pen is a plastic container with three or four parts. The first is a piece of plastic that serves so that, when one of our fish needs to have offspring, it can be isolated from the rest so that they do not harm the offspring.
The best thing about these containers is that it has a piece that allows to separate several females, because it may be the case that two will be played at the same time. There are also other types of containers that have plastic and mesh edges that are sold as if they were hatcheries.
It is then that they can be preyed upon even by their own parents. It also has another utility, such as separating some fish that are sick or causing many conflicts until we see what solution we can offer.
Farrowing pens are quite affordable in price and there are several models. The truth is that they are worth having.
At most it is recommended to keep them for two months and as long as you keep the water in good condition.
Just as these containers can help us to have a better reproduction of our fish, they also have some main drawbacks. The first is the stress it causes in females.
The fact that it is not an aquarium itself does not leave you exempt from obligations such as renewing the water. You can overturn the farrowing pen a little so that the water with the remains of food and excrement come out through the grates.
