Are NB-IoT chips, modules, and industry applications really mature?
For a long time, it is generally believed that NB-IoT chips, modules, and industrial applications have become mature. But if you look deeper, the current NB-IoT chips are still developing and changing continuously, and the perception at the beginning of the year may already be inconsistent with the actual situation at the end of the year.
Whether at home or abroad, the development of NB-IoT industry applications follows a law: starting from the field of metering, expanding to more fields such as smart cities, asset positioning, and smart parking. NB-IoT gas meters, water meters, smoke detectors, electric vehicles, shared white goods, smart street lights, smart parking, smart agriculture, smart door locks, smart tracking and other application scenarios have been expanded to varying degrees.
