It was hard looking around the world and seeing people training in environments drastically different than in the high-performance facilities normally in use in an Olympic year. I wondered, “Should athletes be given special training spaces when that funding could be used to help fight Covid?” There were so many questions, with little answers, it was mentally exhausting to consider all of the global unknowns.
