News - Do you need to wear gloves when doing machining in 2022?
Do you need to wear gloves when doing machining in 2022?
I remember that in the early years, the workers who worked in the factory were specially equipped with a pair of iron-toed labor insurance shoes by the boss. When going to work, all workers had to wear work caps, work clothes, and iron-toed labor insurance shoes on their feet.
