(3) The workpiece, fixture and tool must be firmly clamped. Otherwise, the workpiece will move or even slip out, causing the tool to break or damage, and even cause personal injury and equipment accidents.
(5) The operating position of the valve special machine must be correct. Do not stand in front of the workbench to prevent the workpiece and its relatives from falling and hurting people.
(7) When the valve special machine is running, it is forbidden to load and unload the work, adjust the tool, measure and check the workpiece and remove the chips. When the valve special machine is running, the operator shall not leave the work post.
The most common failure of CNC machining center is chatter. I believe many people are troubled by this problem.
