The cultural movement that took place in England between the XNUMXth and XNUMXth centuries is thus known. The English countryside was one of the last places the Renaissance arrived, as the country was mired in a bloody civil war known as the War of the Two Roses.
El English Renaissance It did not cover as many areas as Italian, but focused much more on literature, highlighting in this field one artist above the rest: the poet, screenwriter and actor William Shakespeare.
Shakespeare He was, together with Queen Elizabeth, the main figure of the English Renaissance. He would end up becoming the most famous playwright of his time and one of the most important in history from then on.
